  "bookId": "HOS",
  "reference": "Hosea 9",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe Isiraeli, leka kushemelerwa! Leka kwesiima nk'amahanga agandi, aha rw'okuba okatera obumalaya, wasigaho Ruhanga wawe. Wagonza kuba malaya, okahongwa aha byano byona ebyo bateleraho emyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai ebyano n'amajungiro g'edivai tibilibatunga, n'edivai mpya tibaligibona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi y'Omukama tibaligiikaramu kyonkai Abaefuraimu baligaruka Misiri; n'omuli Asiria balilyamu ebyakulya bihagaire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mahanga ago tibalibonamu divai ya kuhongera Mukama, tibalitamba na bitambo bikamushemelera. Ekyakulya kyabo kilishusha eky'abali omu rufu, abalikilya bona balihagara. Balilya kutamba enjara kushai, ekyakulya kyabo tibalikitwara Rwensinga y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muligira mutai aha kiro ky'ekyosi, aha kiro kikuru ky'okusingiza Omukama? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba nimugya Asiria; Misiri ebashombokye hamoi, Memfisi ebaziike. Ebintu byanyu by'efeza eby'eiguzi bilibundwa engenyi, amaju ganyu gamerwemu emiti y'amahwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiro by'ekibonabonyio byagoba, obukiro bwakyo buhikire. Omurangi mufera, n'ow'omuchwezi gubanzire ararukire, aha rw'entambara zanyu zingi n'enobi yanyu etali nke ahali inye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omurangi niwe mulinzi wa Efuraimu, abantu ba Ruhanga wange. Kyonkai hona mbali alikugya nibamutega omutego ogw'omutegi w'ebinyonyi. Kandi omu nsi y'Omukama nibanoba omurangiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaire babi bashagulirana nk'omu makiro ga Gibea. Entambara zabo Omukama alizijuka, ababonabonyie nabatura amafu gabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Isiraeli nkamushanga nashusha ezabibu z'omw'irungu. Bashwenkurw'inywe kanabaaboine bakaba nibashusha ebiraba by'omutini gulikuzigaija omu mwaka gwagwo gw'okubanza. Kyonkai kabagobire Baalipeori bayehongera Baali, bahinduka kinyamunuge nka baruhanga abo bagondize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitinwa kya Efuraimu kilitunta nk'enyonyi. Taliho alizara mwana, n'okutwara enda chei, n'okugibaka chei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'orwo balilera abana babo ndibaita obutasigaraho n'omoi. Balikagwamu kandibasigaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwo naboine, abana ba Efuraimu balitwarwa endore, kandi Efuraimu niwe alyebembera abaanabe abo kugya kwitwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obagire otai waitu Mukama! Obanagise enda, obomese amabere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Amafu gabo gona gakamanyikira Giligali",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Giligali",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kigo omuli Isiraeli. Shana haliho ebyabaireho ekitalikumanyikage omu biro bya Hosea.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", niho nabandize kubatamwa. Aha rw'ebigiro byabo bibi ndibabinga omu nsi yange. Tindibagonza rundi, enshonga abatwazi babo nibanshenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaefuraimu bateirwe, nibashusha omuti ogwomire emizi ogutashobora kuraba. N'orwo balizara abana, abana babo abagonzibwa ndibaita.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga wange abantube alibanga. Aha rw'okuba tibamuhulire, balyenjera omu mahanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
